足下，同爲四海國士。夫盛衰迭代，理之恒數，名位參差，運之通塞，豈品德權行爲之者哉？第五之號，旣無易於驃騎；西曹之名，復何推於長史？足下見答書題久之，以君若此非典，何宜施之於國士？如其循禮，禮無不答，謹以相還，亦何犯於逆鱗哉？君子處人，以德不以位，相如不見屈於澠池，毛遂安受辱於郢門，造敵臨事，僕必先於二子。未知足下之貴，足下之威，孰若秦、楚兩王？僕以德爲寶，足下以位爲寶，各寶其寶，於此敬宜。常聞古人交絕，不泄惡言，僕謂之鄙。無以相貽，故薦貧者之贈。」平，潁川人。豫章王嶷爲荊州時，平獻書令減損奢麗，豫章王優教酬答。尚書令王儉當事，平又與儉書曰「足下建高世之名，而不顯高世之迹，將何以書於齊史哉？」至是南郡綱紀啓隨王子隆請罪，平上書自申。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-wangxiuzhi:line019:m0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"隨王","kind":"person","person_id":"4tg_ud8_zdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-wangxiuzhi:line019:m0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"苟平","kind":"person","person_id":"vrt_xfl_ivt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-wangxiuzhi:line019:m0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"秀之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-wangxiuzhi:line019:m0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"秀之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-wangxiuzhi:line019:m0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"vrt_xfl_ivt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-wangxiuzhi:line019:m0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"僕","kind":"person","person_id":"vrt_xfl_ivt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-wangxiuzhi:line019:m0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"信陵","kind":"person","person_id":"h8u_hld_5su","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-wangxiuzhi:line019:m0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"燕丹","kind":"person","person_id":"e3o_2bk_lhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-wangxiuzhi:line019:m0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"荊卿","kind":"person","person_id":"b83_37f_n0v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-wangxiuzhi:line019:m0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"足下","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAABA","status"